{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用单调递减队列保存仍可能成为最大值的元素下标，队首始终对应当前窗口最大值。每加入一个新元素，先移除队首中过期的下标，再从队尾删除不大于新元素的元素；窗口形成后记录队首值。每个下标最多入队、出队一次，因此时间复杂度为 O(n)，额外空间复杂度为 O(k)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>sliding-window-maximum</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.sub{color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:12px}\n.label{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin:6px 0 4px}\n.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,38px);gap:4px}\n.array .cell{position:relative;width:38px;min-height:48px;font-size:13px}\n.array .cell .idx{position:absolute;top:2px;left:3px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell.window{border-color:#3794ff;background:#153b55}\n.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n.box{min-height:64px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#1c1c1c}\n.queue,.result{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;align-items:center}\n.token{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;background:#153b55}\n.token:first-child{background:#0e639c;color:#fff}\n.token.out{opacity:.45}\n.arrow{color:#3794ff;font-size:11px}\n.legend{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:6px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n.bar{height:3px;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n@media(max-width:520px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>滑动窗口 + 单调队列</h1>\n<p class=\"sub mono\">nums = [1,3,-1,-3,5,3,6,7]，k = 3</p>\n<div class=\"label\">数组与窗口</div><div id=\"array\" class=\"array\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div><div class=\"label\">单调队列</div><div class=\"box\"><div id=\"queue\" class=\"queue\"></div></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"label\">窗口最大值</div><div class=\"box\"><div id=\"result\" class=\"result\"></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span>蓝框=窗口</span><span>队首=当前最大</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;margin-top:8px;border-radius:2px\"><div id=\"bar\" class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\nconst nums=[1,3,-1,-3,5,3,6,7],k=3;\nconst frames=[];let q=[],ans=[];\nfor(let i=0;i<nums.length;i++){\n const expired=[];while(q.length&&q[0]<=i-k)expired.push(q.shift());\n const smaller=[];while(q.length&&nums[q[q.length-1]]<=nums[i])smaller.push(q.pop());\n q.push(i);let emitted=null;if(i>=k-1){emitted=nums[q[0]];ans.push(emitted)}\n let parts=[];\n if(expired.length)parts.push(`下标 ${expired.join('、')} 已离开窗口，从队首移除`);\n if(smaller.length)parts.push(`队尾的 ${smaller.map(x=>nums[x]).join('、')} 不大于 ${nums[i]}，以后不可能成为最大值，移除`);\n if(!expired.length&&!smaller.length)parts.push(i===0?'队列为空':`原队尾严格大于 ${nums[i]}，直接保留`);\n parts.push(`将 ${nums[i]}（下标 ${i}）加入队尾`);\n if(emitted!==null)parts.push(`窗口已形成，队首 ${emitted} 就是本轮最大值`);\n else parts.push(`窗口尚未达到 ${k} 个元素，暂不输出`);\n frames.push({i,q:[...q],ans:[...ans],emitted,text:parts.join('；')+'。'});\n}\nconst arr=document.getElementById('array'),queue=document.getElementById('queue'),result=document.getElementById('result'),status=document.getElementById('status'),bar=document.getElementById('bar');\nnums.forEach((v,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='cell';d.innerHTML=`<span class=\"idx\">${i}</span>${v}`;arr.appendChild(d)});\nlet step=0;\nfunction render(){const f=frames[step];[...arr.children].forEach((el,j)=>{el.className='cell';if(j>=Math.max(0,f.i-k+1)&&j<=f.i)el.classList.add('window');if(j===f.i)el.classList.add('current');if(f.emitted!==null&&j===f.q[0])el.classList.add('max')});queue.innerHTML=f.q.map((idx,n)=>`<span class=\"token\">${nums[idx]}<small> [${idx}]</small>${n===0?' 最大':''}</span>`).join('<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>');result.innerHTML=f.ans.length?f.ans.map((v,j)=>`<span class=\"token${j===f.ans.length-1?'':' out'}\">${v}</span>`).join(''):'<span style=\"color:#777\">等待首个完整窗口…</span>';status.innerHTML=`<strong>第 ${f.i+1} 步：</strong>${f.text}`;bar.style.width=((step+1)/frames.length*100)+'%';step=(step+1)%frames.length}\nrender();setInterval(render,2300);\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(k)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为数组长度, k 为窗口大小. 双端队列操作按 O(1) 计, 每个下标至多入队和出队一次. 不含结果; 输出 n-k+1 个最大值另占 O(n-k+1)."
}
